<title>FRANCE: Axa, UAP joint news conference at 1200 GMT.</title>
<headline>Axa, UAP joint news conference at 1200 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurer Axa said there will be a joint news conference at 1200 gmt on its planned alliance with UAP.</p>
<p>The two companies announced plans for an alliance early on Tuesday but have not revealed any details. An industry source said, however, that the deal would be based on a share-swap.</p>
</text>
